NOTE ON BUNDLED DATA AND MODELS (not covered by the MIT license above):

- data/quran_mushaf.db — Qur'anic text (qpc_hafs and related scripts). The
  Qur'anic text itself is not subject to copyright; the database packaging
  derives from the King Fahd Glorious Qur'an Printing Complex (KFGQPC) scripts.
- data/references/*.db — per-ayah timecodes for various reciters, derived from
  community datasets (e.g. quran.com / Tarteel QUL / quran-align), typically
  licensed CC-BY 4.0. Attribution is required; see README "Acknowledgements".
- assets/fonts/qpc_hafs.ttf — KFGQPC HAFS Uthmanic Script font, distributed
  under the KFGQPC font license. Used for on-screen Qur'an text rendering.
- Acoustic models (downloaded/exported at build time, not committed) retain the
  licenses of their upstream Hugging Face repositories.

Redistributors must preserve these notices and the upstream attributions.
